"{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"There is no complete eligible award journey in this packet, so neither award lead is yet a bookable itinerary recommendation. The useful next step is to check the official program site for a full timed itinerary and current availability.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A36@2027-01-12/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"Alaska lead\",\"v\":\"This is the lower displayed points figure among the two leads, for economy on January 12, but it is only a date-only summary: it gives no timed itinerary or confirmed flight and connection details. Its points total is not directly comparable with United’s.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A39@2027-01-13/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"United lead\",\"v\":\"This economy summary is for January 13 and reports more seats than the Alaska summary, but it too is date-only, with no timed itinerary or confirmed connection details. The points totals across these programs do not establish which is better value.\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C1@2027-01-01T22:55-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash baseline\",\"v\":\"The January 1 cash search returned a $640 one-stop itinerary via Hong Kong. It is useful as origin-to-destination cash context, not an all-in award comparison: the price scope is unknown, and the date differs from both award leads. The search returned one traveler; that does not establish the quote’s price scope.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"The award summaries do not establish travel times or routing. Search coverage was partial, and availability and prices should be confirmed with the booking providers.\"}]}"
